    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mommy\u2019s Slipper</strong> is a hilarious stealth-escape game where you must sneak around a quiet town, collect items, and avoid being stunned by an angry mom's flying slipper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small houses, sheds, and alleys to find a way out. Hide under beds or inside wardrobes when you hear her footsteps. But be quick \u2014 one wrong move, and the slipper finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the universal childhood fear of the flying slipper, Mommy\u2019s Slipper mixes light horror, stealth, and cartoon-style humor in a short and replayable single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the town\u2026 or will you get bonked again?<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of stealth and comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide under beds or inside wardrobes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid detection by a reactive AI mom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful items and unlock paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D graphics and light horror tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gore, no violence \u2014 just pure slipper-powered chaos</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mommy\u2019s Slipper</strong> is a hilarious stealth-escape game where you must sneak around a quiet town, collect items, and avoid being stunned by an angry mom's flying slipper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore small houses, sheds, and alleys to find a way out. Hide under beds or inside wardrobes when you hear her footsteps. But be quick \u2014 one wrong move, and the slipper finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the universal childhood fear of the flying slipper, Mommy\u2019s Slipper mixes light horror, stealth, and cartoon-style humor in a short and replayable single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the town\u2026 or will you get bonked again?<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of stealth and comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide under beds or inside wardrobes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid detection by a reactive AI mom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful items and unlock paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D graphics and light horror tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gore, no violence \u2014 just pure slipper-powered chaos</p></li></ul>",
